     "\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<span style=\"font-family:Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif\">Dear all,</span>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<span style=\"font-family:Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif\">during January 8-12, 2024, Dusit Ngoprasert, Ngumbang Juat and I will teach the following 5-day workshop at the King Mongkut’s University of Technology in Bangkok, Thailand:\r\n</span><span style=\"font-size:14pt;font-family:Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;color:rgb(15,92,26)\"><b>&quot;Applied hierarchical modelling of species distribution and abundance with R packages\r\n</b></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:14pt;color:rgb(15,92,26)\"><b>unmarked</b></span><b><span style=\"font-size:14pt;font-family:Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;color:rgb(15,92,26)\">\r\n and </span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:14pt;color:rgb(15,92,26)\">spOccupancy</span></b></span><span style=\"font-size:14pt;font-family:Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;color:rgb(15,92,26)\"><i><b>&quot;</b></i></span><span style=\"font-size:12pt\"><i><u><b><br>\r\n</b></u></i></span></div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif\">The workshop will cover static and dynamic occupancy and N-mixture models, occupancy models with species interactions, and distance sampling (all with unmarked) and spatial\r\n models of occupancy (with the new spOccupancy package).</span></div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<span style=\"font-family:Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif\">Please see the attached flyer for more information about the course and for how to apply.</span></div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<span style=\"font-family:Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif\">Best regards -- Marc</span><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n"
